{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807620/extras/4defa10adedd0e47b28a12ade6d354a0.webp?t=1755153678\" width=656 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brian, an exiled feline with magical abilities, stumbles upon a dungeon that serves as a portal to a world ruled by cosmic beings. Armed with his arcane powers, he must survive the horrors that await him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807620/extras/cd8ceb33e61e3b2fbf8a817ea7686e57.poster.avif?t=1755153678\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807620/extras/cd8ceb33e61e3b2fbf8a817ea7686e57.webm?t=1755153678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807620/extras/cd8ceb33e61e3b2fbf8a817ea7686e57.mp4?t=1755153678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of character traits (hyper, angry, hot, cold, and many more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807620/extras/03d97fe37f170feb846ad43c464c2bf5.avif?t=1755153678\" width=645 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items with multiple rarities to choose from (mundane, scarce, mythical)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807620/extras/2414984f7c78f